{"type":"assistant.message","data":{"messageId":"4f579b3d-abee-4685-8a72-5c42e7d8d4ef","content":"","toolRequests":[{"toolCallId":"call_alOaxtMetLqydttbxdyhD8Jw","name":"create","arguments":{"path":"/home/runner/work/cola/cola/artifacts/4393767066/result.md","file_text":"# 人因工程圖 — 正確與錯誤站姿\n\n說明：此檔案包含可直接用於 AI 圖像生成器的提示詞（英文）以及簡短的版面說明，目標產出一張對比圖，左側為「正確站姿」，右側展示多種常見的「錯誤站姿」並附簡短標註與改善建議。\n\n---\n\n提示詞（英文，直接貼入圖像生成器）：\n\"Infographic poster showing ergonomic standing posture: left panel titled 'Correct Posture' with a neutral, upright human figure (side and front view), head aligned over shoulders, natural S-curve spine, relaxed knees, weight evenly distributed on both feet, feet hip-width apart. Right panel titled 'Incorrect Postures' showing 4 small vignettes: 1) Slouched/rounded shoulders, 2) Forward head posture, 3) Locked knees and hyperextension, 4) Weight shifted to one leg/pelvic tilt. Use clean flat vector style, high-contrast annotations, arrows and short labels pointing to problem areas, short corrective tips under each vignette. Color palette: muted teal for correct (greenish), warm red/orange for incorrect, neutral background. Typography: clear sans-serif, legible labels. Include icons for spine, feet, and clock for tips. Layout: A4 portrait 2480x3508 px, margin for printing. Minimal realistic human anatomy, gender-neutral figures, accessible design, high readability.\"\n\n可選的 negative prompt（減少不必要細節）：\n\"photorealistic, heavy shadows, busy background, text-heavy, low-resolution, noisy\"\n\n---\n\n版面與使用建議：\n- 建議尺寸：A4 2480×3508 px（印刷）或 1920×1080 px（簡報）。\n- 色彩與標註：正確姿勢使用冷色（綠/藍），錯誤姿勢使用暖色（紅/橘），箭頭與標籤使用深色加白色描邊以提高可讀性。\n- 標註內容範例（每個錯誤旁）：\n  - Slouched: \"Rounded shoulders → Tight chest muscles, weak upper back\"\n  - Forward head: \"Forward head → Neck strain, increased disc load\"\n  - Locked knees: \"Locked knees → Reduced shock absorption, hyperextension\"\n  - Weight shift: \"Shifted weight → Pelvic tilt, uneven load\"\n- 底部可加一行簡短改善建議：\"Keep chin tucked, shoulders relaxed, micro-breaks every 30–60 min, alternate weight evenly.\"\n\n使用此提示詞可在 Midjourney、Stable Diffusion、DALL·E 等圖像生成器中生成清晰的對比人因工程圖，如需我直接幫忙生成（並附檔案），請告知要使用的生成器與輸出格式。"},"type":"function","intentionSummary":"create a new file at /home/runner/work/cola/cola/artifacts/4393767066/result.md."}],"interactionId":"3b048222-d42a-41fc-8f99-0b77530b59e1","outputTokens":700,"requestId":"CC00:3932DE:3817629:3D639B4:69FBF9E0"},"id":"c1979153-c6be-4b3f-ad69-41b2a1aabc1f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T02:33:14.627Z","parentId":"a2a3daa5-f6cc-4b59-9322-fda4f098c1a2"}
